---

## 1. Project Overview
Backend for BFSI Sales & Lead Portal, built with FastAPI and PostgreSQL, providing REST APIs for user authentication, customer, product, and lead management, along with dashboard metrics.

---

## 2. Prerequisites
- Python 3.10+  
- PostgreSQL 13+  
- Virtual environment (`venv`)  
- Environment variables (see `.env`)

---

## 3. Environment Variables
Create a `.env` file in `backend/`:

```env
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://postgres:Yukta.r#250825@localhost/bfsi_db
AUTHJWT_SECRET_KEY=supersecretkey



python -m venv .venv
.\.venv\Scripts\activate     # Windows
# or source .venv/bin/activate  # Linux / Mac

# Step 2: Install dependencies
pip install -r requirements.txt



## 2. Complete List of Key API Endpoints

### Users / Admin

| Method | Endpoint           | Description                       |
|--------|------------------|-----------------------------------|
| POST   | /users/login      | Login and get JWT token           |
| POST   | /users/refresh    | Refresh access token using refresh token |
| POST   | /users/logout     | Logout and revoke refresh token  |
| POST   | /users/           | Create a new user                 |
| GET    | /users/           | List all users                    |
| GET    | /users/{user_id}  | Get user details                  |

### Customers

| Method | Endpoint                        | Description                   |
|--------|--------------------------------|-------------------------------|
| POST   | /customers/                     | Create a customer             |
| GET    | /customers/                     | List customers                |
| GET    | /customers/{customer_id}        | Get customer by ID            |
| PUT    | /customers/{customer_id}        | Update customer               |
| DELETE | /customers/{customer_id}        | Delete customer               |
| GET    | /customers/count-by-product     | Customers per product         |

### Products

| Method | Endpoint                        | Description                   |
|--------|--------------------------------|-------------------------------|
| POST   | /products/                      | Create a product              |
| GET    | /products/                      | List products                 |
| GET    | /products/{product_id}          | Get product by ID             |
| PUT    | /products/{product_id}          | Update product                |
| DELETE | /products/{product_id}          | Delete product                |

### Leads

| Method | Endpoint                        | Description                   |
|--------|--------------------------------|-------------------------------|
| POST   | /leads/                         | Create a lead                 |
| GET    | /leads/                         | List leads                    |
| GET    | /leads/{lead_id}                | Get lead by ID                |
| PUT    | /leads/{lead_id}                | Update lead                   |
| DELETE | /leads/{lead_id}                | Delete lead                   |
| GET    | /leads/count-by-status          | Count leads by status         |


